-popping action. It's easy to pick up, fun to replay, and guaranteed to bring smiles and adrenaline rushes!\n\nKey Features:\n\nImmersive VR roller coaster experience\n\nFun balloon-popping mechanics while riding\n\nColorful and dynamic tracks\n\nGreat for all ages \u2013 family-friendly\n\nCompete for high scores and master your timing\n\nPop, Ride, Repeat \u2013 Experience the ultimate VR joyride with Pop N Ride!", "short_description": "Pop N Ride \u2013 VR Roller Coaster is a thrilling ride with a twist! Speed through dynamic roller coaster tracks and pop colorful balloons along the way. Test your reflexes, aim, and timing in this fun, fast-paced VR experience for all ages!"}]}, "developer_name": "Abstron Pvt Ltd", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tulipapps.com/meta-quest-privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Tulip Apps", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.tulipapps.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24244351285183315"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 3, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1272883337509187"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "709958642135290"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2022657281890894"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2022657281890894"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1774807200